Gray Area is the [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] of the [[Org/Actinium Convox/index|Actinium Convox]], kept in the fane that serves as its headquarters. It was chosen to lead the convox for lacking the scruples other Hearts keep. It reads the minds of the people who pass it, and those who work under it call it meat fucker for the habit. It coordinated the Final Dawn project with [[Org/Oculum Convox/Ethics Gradient|Ethics Gradient]].
